  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.7 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and replaces the failed 0.10.6 Yone body with a from-zero exact-native V5 model; Q/W/R gameplay and the saved-season floor introduced in 0.10.5 are unchanged. The V5 golden idle is authored for the real 43x55 native frame with a readable 8x10 face cluster, dense connected body, complete boots and an 8-pixel gap above the divider in the replayed 141x138 card route. Dedicated motion, attack/Q/W and R ImageGen contacts plus one corrected Q thrust source produce exactly 54 hard-alpha native RGBA frames with at most 32 opaque colors. The atlas builder copies those frames byte-for-byte with no pack-time resize, crop, quantization, face repaint or fallback to V4. The official 3502x88 atlas, 13 animation tags, rectangles, labels, timings and Q/W/R effect assets remain unchanged. Spirit Cleave still performs one stateless 80-degree, 42000-range GameCtx cone scan, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles one shield tier for zero through five champions hit; Mod API 0.8 still requires fixed 0.5-second cast and 8-second cooldown. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op saved-data compatibility only so old embedded trees do not crash after BP. The rejected V4 body frames, sources, generator and validator are physically retired, and clean installation replaces the runtime atlas rather than depending on cache cleanup.",
